---
---

<section id="case-files" class="py-24 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12">
  <div class="mb-12 reveal">
    <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[4px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
      — Incident Case Files (HTB Sherlocks)
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="cyber-frame p-8 sm:p-12 reveal reveal-d1">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-muted)] uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 border border-[var(--border-frame)] px-3 py-1 bg-[var(--bg-elevated)]">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent-progress)] animate-pulse"></span>
        Active Investigations Pipeline
      </div>

      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-4 uppercase tracking-tight">
        Real-World Incident Response Case Reports
      </h3>

      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--text-body)] leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Hands-on DFIR investigation case reports from HTB Sherlocks and enterprise security labs. Each case file details full forensic triage, log parsing, and detection engineering:
      </p>

      <!-- Standard Documentation Structure Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] py-6 mb-8">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] block">01 // Introduction & Scenario</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]">Sherlock name, difficulty, and initial investigative alert premise.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] block">02 // Tools & Environment</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]">Wireshark, Volatility 3, Eric Zimmerman's tools, Autopsy, EVTX ECmd.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] block">03 // Step-by-Step Investigation</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]">Sequential task analysis, commands, Wireshark filters, and registry paths.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] block">04 // Evidence & IOCs</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]">Extracted hashes, malicious IPs, file artifacts, and MITRE ATT&CK mapping.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)] italic">
        * First batch of completed Sherlock case reports will appear here upon final writeup validation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
